  "contentHtml": "<p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">마가린과 버터의 차이를 아는 아이들이 의외로 많지 않아 이런 수업을 창안해 보았습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">제목 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">: </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">마가린</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">버터</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">식용유의 차이점에 관한 탐구</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">준비물 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">: </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">마가린</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">버터</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">식용유</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">식빵</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">달걀</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">방법</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">&nbsp;1. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">마가린</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">버터</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">식용유는 도대체 무엇으로 어떻게 만드는지</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">… </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">자료를 찾아 탐구지에 기록합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">&nbsp;2. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">팀별로 마가린</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">버터</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">식용유를 각각 나누어주고 토스트용 식빵을 굽게 합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">&nbsp;3. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">접시에 담고 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">A, B, C</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">로 표시합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">&nbsp;4. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">골고루 맛보고 자신이 가장 맛있다고 생각한 곳에 스티커를 붙입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">이름이 적힌 덮개를 열었더니 식용유에 구은 식빵에 가장 많은 표가 붙었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">식용유를 사용한 우리 반 아이들이 환호성을 지르더군요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">얼마나 잘 구웠으면 그랬을까 하고요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">혹시 입맛이 저렴</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">(?)</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">해서 그런 것이 아닐까라는 말도 나와서 서로 한참을 웃었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">달걀의 구조 역시 아는 아이들이 많지 않아 생달걀을 깨뜨려 구조를 찬찬히 관찰하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">그 이후부터는 어떤 토스트를 만들 것인지 팀별로 의논하여 결정하고 진행하게 했습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">계란을 입혀 노릇하게 굽고 설탕가루를 뿌린 달달한 맛의 길거리표 토스트가 단연 인기를 끌었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">과학실 청소하러 들어온 우리 반 아이들이 남은 재료로 갖은 재주를 부렸고요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">한 아이가 식빵을 잘게 자르더니 바싹 구워 설탕을 솔솔 뿌려 종이컵에 나누어 담네요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">이보다 더 맛있는 간식 있으면 나와 보라고 하고 싶습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">과학실에서는 먹고 마시지 않는다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">.’</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">는 안전수칙을 명심하며 탐구 전에도 부지런히 쓸고 닦았습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">제가 수업하는 과학실은 시약을 사용하지 않는 공간이지만 대청소는 필수라는 생각이 들었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\">늦게까지 뒷정리 하느라 몸은 고단하나 아이들이 행복해 하는 모습을 떠올리니 흐뭇합니다. 초상권 때문에 아이들의 모습을 올리지 못하여 아쉽습니다.</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\"><br></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\"><br></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/212F574F58378EA41D\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"SDC13838.jpg\"  id=\"A_212F574F58378EA41DD56B\"/></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 250;\"><br></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><img src=\"h